{"id":"wb-5-361","name":"襄阳城墙","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"襄阳城","text":"襄阳城位于湖北省西北部的襄阳市、汉水中游南岸。三面环水，一面靠山，城高池深，易守难攻，被誉为“铁打的襄阳”和“华夏第一城池”，故为历代兵家所看重。2001年，襄阳城墙被中华人民共和国国务院公布为第五批全国重点文物保护单位之一。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E8%A5%84%E9%98%B3%E5%9F%8E","revisionId":92260747,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=92260747","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/1f19f57ce854b260b6b9faf8.jpg","title":"Xiangyang_City_Wall_06.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:Xiangyang_City_Wall_06.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/b/b2/Xiangyang_City_Wall_06.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Fxqf","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"​全国重点文物保护单位襄阳城墙","width":320,"height":240}}